sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Agent code
    participant F as adapters.<framework>.factory
    participant W as wrapped framework model
    participant S as active_session()
    participant Sig as extract_signature
    participant Cursor as ReplaySession cursor
    participant C as _common.build_live_span
    participant DB as timetravel.db

    Note over A,DB: Setup: trace seeded with N LLM spans.<br/>ReplaySession opened in FROZEN mode. No framework installed at import time.

    Note over A,DB: Stage 0 — module import (no framework required)
    A->>F: import timetravel.adapters.adk  (or any of the four)
    Note right of F: NO framework import happens<br/>at module load. Only at factory call.

    Note over A,DB: Stage 1 — factory call (framework resolved lazily)
    A->>F: replay_llm(wrapped, trace_id="…")
    F->>F: from google.adk.models.llms import BaseLlm  (lazy)
    alt framework not installed
        F-->>A: raise AdapterError("install with pip install agent-timetravel[adk]")
    else framework installed
        F->>F: define _ReplayLlm(BaseLlm) in closure scope
        F-->>A: return _ReplayLlm(wrapped, trace_id)
    end

    Note over A,DB: Stage 2 — frozen replay dispatch (zero egress)
    A->>F: _ReplayLlm.generate_response(request)
    F->>S: active_session()
    alt session is None
        F->>W: wrapped.generate_response(request)
        W-->>F: live result
        F-->>A: pass-through (no capture)
    else session is not None
        F->>Sig: extract_signature(model=…, messages=…)
        Sig-->>F: CallSignature(model, messages_hash, tools_hash)
        F->>Cursor: respond_or_forward(signature)
        alt hash matches a recorded span
            Cursor->>Cursor: advance_cursor
            Cursor-->>F: RecordedResponse(payload, span_id, timetravel_id, model)
            F->>F: materialise payload → framework response type
            Note right of F: NO outbound HTTP / SDK call
            F-->>A: recorded response
        else hash does not match (divergence)
            Cursor-->>F: RecordedResponse = None
            F->>C: assert_not_frozen(session)
            Note right of C: FROZEN mode is strict-determinism
            C-->>A: raise ReplayError("frozen replay diverged at cursor=N")
        end
    end
